h14.
**computation site:** `memopayload.RebuildMemoPayload` (`server/runner/memopayload/runner.go`) calling `markdown.Service.ExtractAll` (`internal/markdown/markdown.go`); **triggers:** `CreateMemo`, `UpdateMemo` when the update mask includes `"content"` (and `CreateMemoComment` indirectly via `CreateMemo`); **extracted properties:** `#tags` → `payload.tags`; from markdown AST → `payload.property` (`title`, `has_link`, `has_code`, `has_task_list`, `has_incomplete_tasks`)

Derived metadata lives in `MemoPayload` (`proto/store/memo.proto`) — mainly **`tags`** and **`property`**. Location is user-supplied, not content-derived.

**Where it is computed**

`RebuildMemoPayload` parses content and writes into the memo payload:

```74:87:server/runner/memopayload/runner.go
func RebuildMemoPayload(_ context.Context, memo *store.Memo, markdownService markdown.Service) error {
	if memo.Payload == nil {
		memo.Payload = &storepb.MemoPayload{}
	}

	data, err := markdownService.ExtractAll([]byte(memo.Content))
	// ...
	memo.Payload.Tags = data.Tags
	memo.Payload.Property = data.Property
	return nil
}
```

`ExtractAll` walks the goldmark AST and fills `ExtractedData`:

```376:405:internal/markdown/markdown.go
		if tagNode, ok := asMemoTagNode(n); ok {
			data.Tags = append(data.Tags, string(tagNode.Tag))
		}
		// ...
		if heading, ok := n.(*gast.Heading); ok && heading.Level == 1 {
			data.Property.Title = extractHeadingText(n, content)
		}
		switch n.Kind() {
		case gast.KindLink:
			data.Property.HasLink = true
		case gast.KindCodeBlock, gast.KindFencedCodeBlock, gast.KindCodeSpan:
			data.Property.HasCode = true
		case east.KindTaskCheckBox:
			data.Property.HasTaskList = true
			if checkBox, ok := n.(*east.TaskCheckBox); ok {
				if !checkBox.IsChecked {
					data.Property.HasIncompleteTasks = true
				}
			}
```

Only **tags** and **property** are persisted; `ExtractAll` also collects **mentions**, but `RebuildMemoPayload` does not store them (mentions are handled separately in `server/router/api/v1/memo_mention_helpers.go`).

**What triggers recomputation**

| Operation | File | When |
|---|---|---|
| **`CreateMemo`** | `server/router/api/v1/memo_service.go:108` | Always, before `Store.CreateMemo` |
| **`UpdateMemo`** | `server/router/api/v1/memo_service.go:447` | Only when update mask path is `"content"` |
| **`CreateMemoComment`** | `server/router/api/v1/memo_service_comments.go:56` | Indirectly — calls `CreateMemo` |

`memopayload.Runner.RunOnce` (`server/runner/memopayload/runner.go:27`) can batch-rebuild all memos, but it is **not** wired into server startup (`server/server.go` has no `memopayload` reference).

**Use in lists/previews**

Stored payload fields are exposed on API memos in `convertMemoFromStoreWithCreators` (`server/router/api/v1/memo_service_converter.go:47-50`) as `Tags` and `Property`, and used for stats/filtering (e.g. `server/router/api/v1/user_service_stats.go`). **Snippets** for previews are computed at read time via `GenerateSnippet` (`memo_service_converter.go:76-80`), not stored in `payload`.

